title UC.24 - Departmental Shift Handover Reporting & Sign-off

|Standard User (Employee)|
start
:1. Select Create Shift Handover Report;
|GraphMind System|
:2. Load shift handover form scoped to employee department;
|Standard User (Employee)|
:3. Enter shift name, date, completed tasks,\nincidents encountered, and handover notes;
if (Select submission action?) then (Save Draft [A1])
  |GraphMind System|
  :4a. Save report with status = DRAFT\n(editable by employee, hidden from review queue);
  stop
else (Submit Report [Main Flow])
  |GraphMind System|
  :4b. Validate mandatory fields\n(completed_tasks, handover_notes);
  if (All required fields valid?) then (No [E1])
    :Highlight empty mandatory fields & return validation error;
    |Standard User (Employee)|
    :Correct missing fields on form;
    stop
  else (Yes)
    |GraphMind System|
    :5. Save report with status = SUBMITTED\n(lock employee editing) (FR55);
    :6. Notify Department Manager of pending shift report;
  endif
endif

|Department Manager|
:7. Open Department Shift Reviews & select report;
|GraphMind System|
if (Manager belongs to report department?) then (No [E2])
  :Return HTTP 403 Forbidden (BR-02 Department Scope);
  stop
else (Yes)
  |Department Manager|
  :8. Review shift details & enter Manager Remarks;
  if (Manager review decision?) then (Request Revision [A2])
    :9a. Enter mandatory revision reason;
    |GraphMind System|
    :10a. Set status = REJECTED & unlock report for editing;
    :11a. Write Audit Log & notify employee to revise;
    stop
  else (Sign-off & Approve [Main Flow])
    |Department Manager|
    :9b. Click Sign-off & Approve (FR56);
    |GraphMind System|
    :10b. Set status = APPROVED, record signed_by_manager_id\nand approved_at timestamp (permanently locked);
    :11b. Write Audit Log (SHIFT_APPROVED) & mark ready\nfor Daily Automated Consolidation (UC.25);
    stop
  endif
endif
@enduml